---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Maritime Labour Convention (MLC) Certification | Eurocert"
  description="MLC 2006 Maritime Labour Convention certification - seafarer employment, health and welfare audits for shipowners and manning agencies by Eurocert Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/mlc/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367925/eurocert/b5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="MLC Maritime Labour Convention"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">The Seafarers&#x27; Bill of Rights</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">MLC  -  <span class="text-eurogold-400">Maritime Labour Convention</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">International agreement of the ILO setting out seafarers&#x27; rights to decent conditions of work  -  ratified by 90 countries covering over 91% of the world&#x27;s shipping fleet</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Convention Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">MLC 2006?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The Maritime Labour Convention 2006 (MLC) is an international agreement of the International Labour Organisation (ILO) which sets out seafarers&#x27; rights to decent conditions of work. It is sometimes called the <strong class="text-slate-700">&quot;Seafarers&#x27; Bill of Rights&quot;</strong>. It applies to all seafarers, including those with jobs in hotel and other passenger services on cruise ships and commercial yachts.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">As of January 2019, a total of <strong class="text-slate-700">90 countries</strong> had ratified the MLC 2006, which has resulted in more than <strong class="text-slate-700">91% of the world&#x27;s shipping fleet</strong> being regulated by this convention.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-anchor text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Eurocert&#x27;s MLC Experience</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert S.A has been doing MLC audits for recruiting companies and shipping companies against compliance of MLC. Our experienced maritime auditors ensure thorough assessment of all MLC requirements for your operations.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784011275/mlc_qrufli.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="MLC Maritime Labour Convention"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Convention Highlights</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Highlights of <span class="text-euro-600">MLC 2006</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-home text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Minimum Working &amp; Living Conditions</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ensuring decent accommodation, food, and living standards for all seafarers aboard ships.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Safe &amp; Secure Workplace</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Mandating occupational safety and health protection measures for all maritime workers.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Fair Terms of Employment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Regulating employment agreements, wages, hours of work, and repatriation rights.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-heartbeat text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Health Protection</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Access to medical care, health protection, and social security for seafarers.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-hands-helping text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Welfare Measures</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Shore-based welfare facilities, recreation, and communication access for crew members.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-child text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">No Child Labor</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Strict minimum age requirements to prevent child labor in the maritime industry.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Latest Updates</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">2019 <span class="text-eurogold-400">Amendments</span></h3><p class="text-white/40 text-sm mt-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">A second set of amendments to the Maritime Labour Convention (MLC) for improving crew safety and welfare came into force on 8 January 2019</p></div><div class="space-y-4 mb-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">01</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Account is to be taken of the latest version of the guidance on eliminating shipboard harassment and bullying, jointly published by the International Chamber of Shipping (ICS) and the International Transport Workers&#x27; Federation (ITF).</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">02</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">In addition to the various health and safety matters which the MLC requires should be taken into account, there is added &#x27;harassment and bullying&#x27;.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-xs">03</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">To the list of matters which should be considered for investigation in a health and safety context, there is added &#x27;problems arising from harassment and bullying&#x27;.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle text-eurogold-400 text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-eurogold-400">Important:</strong> Bullying and harassment, including sexual harassment, is an abuse of human rights and living on a ship offers limited alternatives to avoid it. Although these changes are non-mandatory, flag states must give due consideration to implementing them.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">MLC Audit <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-ship text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">MLC Compliance Audits</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive audits against MLC 2006 requirements for recruiting and shipping companies.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-user-shield text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Seafarer Rights Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification of seafarer employment conditions, wages, and welfare provisions.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-hard-hat text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Working Conditions Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assessment of on-board working conditions including hours, rest periods, and safety.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-bed text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Accommodation &amp; Food Standards</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Inspection of living quarters, recreational facilities, and catering standards.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-heartbeat text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Health &amp; Medical Care Review</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Review of medical care provisions, health protection measures, and social security.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Employment Agreement Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification of seafarer employment agreements and terms of service.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-flag text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Flag State Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ensuring compliance with flag state requirements under MLC 2006.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-anchor text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Port State Inspection Readiness</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Preparing vessels and companies for port state control inspections.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Audit Partner</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Why Choose <span class="text-euro-600">Eurocert?</span></h2></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in maritime compliance, MLC implementation and related conformity assessment.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-ship text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Maritime Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Eurocert S.A has been doing MLC audits for recruiting companies and shipping companies against compliance of MLC. Our auditors bring deep understanding of maritime labour standards and international conventions.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Certification through this alliance means evaluation by an accredited, internationally recognised third-party body, with regional coordination and auditor access supported by Eurocert Asia in line with Eurocert SA, Athens.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-euro-100 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">90</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries Ratified</span></div><div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-euro-100 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">91%</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Fleet Regulated</span></div><div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-euro-100 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Eurocert Countries</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight